{
  "Npcs.Minotaur.Desc": "An angry-looking minotaur looms over you. Covered in shaggy {0} fur, the beast is an imposing sight. Wearing little but an obviously distended loincloth, he is clearly already plotting his method of punishment. Like most minotaurs he has hooves, a cow-like tail and face, prominent horns, and impressive musculature."
  "Npcs.Minotaur.Desc.Axe": " <b>This minotaur seems to have found a deadly looking axe somewhere!</b>"
  "Npcs.Minotaur.Desc.BigBalls": " Barely visible below the tattered shreds of loincloth are {0}, swollen with the minotaur's long pent-up need."
  "Npcs.Minotaur.Name": "minotaur"
}
